---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import hero from '../assets/workshop.jpg';
---
<section id="home" class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <Image src={hero} alt="Detailer carefully machine-polishing a car's paintwork" widths={[640, 960, 1440, 1920]} sizes="100vw" format="webp" quality={80} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="hero-image" />
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="hero-heading"><div class="eyebrow hero-kicker"><span>PAINT CORRECTION · CERAMIC · PPF</span><span>LUCKNOW, INDIA</span></div><h1 id="hero-title">THE ART OF<br/>A BETTER<br/><span class="outline-text">FINISH.</span></h1></div>
  <div class="hero-bottom"><div><p>Careful paint correction. Considered protection.<br/>Detailing shaped by patience, precision and craft.</p><a class="button button-light" href="#expertise">Explore detailing services <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><a class="scroll-cue" href="#introduction"><span>SCROLL TO DISCOVER</span><span class="scroll-line" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><span class="hero-index">01 / THE FINISH</span></div>
</section>
